:: Carter Bedroom Relax Bed [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> yawns and slumps down, lying down on his bed perpendicular to what he normally would, a good third of his body dangling off the end as he stares up at the ceiling, his normal bubbling burst of energy replaced by a groggy heap. <span style="color:Pink">You chuckle at the boy and lie down next to him, your shoulders touching, and stare up as well, asking him what’s so interesting about the ceiling.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Nothing.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Just a little tired from playing and stuff. I don’t want to nap or nothing, but relaxing is nice.”</span> You nod, relaxing is nice, though it is a little weird to see the normally bursting with energy <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tired. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Well, even heroes need their rest! It’s very important!”</span> He points out. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You know, schools should bring back nap time. I mean, we don’t NEED it, but I always feel great after a nap.”</span> You agree and ask him if he wants to nap now. He seems to think it over for a minute, but eventually shakes his head. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Nah, just lying down is good. Is that okay with you?”</span> He turns to you with a smile. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightGreen">The two of you just relax on his bed together for the next few minutes, chatting about random things that only seem important in this moment or just about nothing at all. Sometimes you just sit in silence for a few minutes, the only sounds in the room each other’s breathing and the occasional creak of the bed. It’s nice.</span> <br>

<span style="color:Green">+Carter Energy</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Energy += 10>>
<span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
<<needChange "Energy" 10>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
<br>
